# Castafiore - Session Log

## 2026-08-04
- Lyrics background: on mobile FullScreenPlayer the lyrics now render as a full-screen
  layer (`Lyric` style=`StyleSheet.absoluteFill`) behind the controls; `CoverItem` returns
  null for the LYRICS preview. Controls are pushed to the bottom in lyrics mode.
  Desktop FullScreenHorizontalPlayer already had a full-screen background; unchanged.
  Backed by the existing cover/solid-color background setting in Player settings.
- Search results: added a list/grid view toggle to SearchMore. Grid reuses the existing
  `AllItem` tile in a flexWrap container (native: 2 columns via `flex:1, maxWidth:'50%'`,
  web: auto-fill). Infinite scroll kept via `onScroll` near-bottom detection in grid mode.
  Added an optional `right` slot to the shared `Header` for the toggle button.
- Whole album Play next: added a "Play next" option to OptionsAlbum that inserts all album
  tracks right after the current song. Uses `addToQueue(songDispatch, track, song.index + 1)`
  in reverse order to preserve album track order (the reducer inserts at `index` and shifts).

## Tips / gotchas
- `addToQueue(songDispatch, track, index)` inserts at `index`; inserting at the same
  `index` repeatedly reverses order, so insert in reverse to keep wanted order.
